Scope of this license

The MIT license below covers only the free content in this repository:
- README.md
- templates/<slug>/prompt.md for the free templates (Nightshift, Alder & Tide, Kite)

The files in previews/ show onepaste templates for promotion only. They are not licensed under MIT and all rights to them are reserved. Premium templates are not published in this repository: their prompts are not included here. Each premium template is only shown as a preview, with a link to its page on onepaste.dev, where it can be bought.

